`,s.jsx(t,{label:"Why this is the core problem",children:s.jsx(e.p,{children:"The KV cache lives in GPU memory (HBM), grows linearly with both sequence length and concurrent request count, and cannot be compressed without losing information (unlike weights). Managing it efficiently is the single biggest job of a production inference server."})}),`
